OL,3,AGiant jellyfish with '40ft tentacles'
OL,4,Acaptured on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FA free diver has said he "couldn't
OL,7,Fbelieve his luck" after spotting a
OL,8,Fgiant jellyfish off the Welsh
OL,9,Fcoastline.
OL,11,FIestyn Morgan, from Pembrokeshire, said
OL,12,Fthe lion's mane was the "length of a
OL,13,Fbus" with a size of about 10 to 15
OL,14,Fmetres (32ft 8in to 49ft 2in).
OL,16,FThe 21-year-old conservationist, who
OL,17,Frecords footage for social media to
OL,18,Fraise awareness about the "threats our
OL,19,Fseas are facing", said it was the first
OL,20,Flion's mane he had seen in Wales.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
